# Pinned CI tool versions for the kareem.one self-hosted runners.
#
# Every SHA256 below is the digest of the exact artifact the Containerfile downloads.
# The Containerfile verifies each download with `sha256sum -c` before use.
# Never write a checksum that you did not compute from the downloaded artifact.
#
# To bump a tool: change the version, download the new artifact, run
# `sha256sum <artifact>`, and paste the real digest. See README.md.

